-- born on 31 December: at a 2025 accident the age on the next birthday is 2025 - birth year
`age 30` MEANS YMD 1995 12 31
`age 40` MEANS YMD 1985 12 31
`age 45` MEANS YMD 1980 12 31
`age 60` MEANS YMD 1965 12 31
`age 66` MEANS YMD 1959 12 31
`pre` MEANS YMD 2025 6 1
`post` MEANS YMD 2025 11 1

-- [F3] death, capped at 225,000
#ASSERT `the death compensation for an AME of` 2000 `, born` `age 30` `, accident on` `pre` EQUALS 225000
-- [F4] post-Nov
#ASSERT `the death compensation for an AME of` 2000 `, born` `age 30` `, accident on` `post` EQUALS 246000
-- [F5] 31 Oct 2025
#ASSERT `the death compensation for an AME of` 2000 `, born` `age 30` `, accident on` (YMD 2025 10 31) EQUALS 225000
-- [F6] floor 76,000
#ASSERT `the death compensation for an AME of` 500 `, born` `age 66` `, accident on` `pre` EQUALS 76000
-- [F7] floor 91,000
