§§ `I. Payees and payment (ss 18-23, 59, refunds)`

GIVEN died IS A BOOLEAN, exec IS A BOOLEAN, incap IS A BOOLEAN, donee IS A BOOLEAN, minor IS A BOOLEAN, pi IS A BOOLEAN, s20 IS A BOOLEAN, dep IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Payee facts`
`payee` died exec incap donee minor pi s20 dep MEANS
    `Payee facts` WITH
        `the claimant has died` IS died
        `an executor or administrator is known to be appointed` IS exec
        `the claimant lacks capacity in property and affairs` IS incap
        `a donee or deputy with power to receive the payment` IS donee
        `the claimant is below 18` IS minor
        `for permanent or current incapacity` IS pi
        `the Commissioner has directed payment to relatives` IS s20
        `the Commissioner has directed a deposit` IS dep

