§§ `J. Process (Part 4)`

GIVEN acc IS A DATE
      died IS A MAYBE DATE
      notice IS A MAYBE DATE
      later IS A MAYBE DATE
      wd IS A MAYBE DATE
      res IS A MAYBE DATE
      approved IS A BOOLEAN
      claim IS A MAYBE DATE
      notified IS A BOOLEAN
      stmt IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Claim history`
`history` acc died notice later wd res approved claim notified stmt MEANS
    `Claim history` WITH
        `accident on` IS acc
        `claimant died on` IS died
        `employer first had notice on` IS notice
        `later date specified by the Commissioner` IS later
        `withdrawn on` IS wd
        `resumed on` IS res
        `the Commissioner approved a late resumption` IS approved
        `incapacity claim made on` IS claim
        `notified of assessment for permanent or current incapacity` IS notified
        `incapacity claim had a health professional's statement` IS stmt

