`o30-3` MEANS `s 30(3) — insurance that is not an approved policy`
`o34P-1` MEANS `s 34P(1) — platform operator not insured`
`o34P-4` MEANS `s 34P(4) — platform operator deducting insurance cost from earnings`
`o35-8` MEANS `s 35(8) — failing to give the Commissioner notice of an accident`
`o50-4` MEANS `s 50(4) — failing to comply with a direction`
`o61-1` MEANS `s 61(1) — failing to pay compensation`
`o61-3` MEANS `s 61(3) — failing to deposit interest`
`o61-5` MEANS `s 61(5) — failing to make a directed deposit`
`o62-1` MEANS `s 62(1) — false or misleading information`
`o62-3a` MEANS `s 62(3)(a) — dishonestly obtaining compensation`
`o62-3b` MEANS `s 62(3)(b) — dishonestly avoiding liability to pay compensation`
`o68-6` MEANS `s 68(6) — obstructing the Commissioner or an investigation officer`
`o82-3` MEANS `s 82(3) — contravening the regulations`

